  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27509001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "格雷豪斯",
          "text": "再比一次！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27509002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "啊？还要来？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27509003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "格雷豪斯",
          "text": "难道以为老子看不出你一直在放水吗？小鬼！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27509004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "格雷豪斯",
          "text": "让我看看和这个世界人类的力量差距吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27509005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "呃，那好吧……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27509006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "格雷豪斯",
          "text": "吃我一斧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27509007",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "砰！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27509008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "格雷豪斯",
          "text": "唔……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27509009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "喂喂，没事吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27509010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "格雷豪斯",
          "text": "……有意思，哈哈，看来这里注定也是一个不会让人无聊的地方！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27509011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "格雷豪斯",
          "text": "等一下，小鬼，你要做什么？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27509012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你看起来好像受伤了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27509013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "格雷豪斯",
          "text": "我不需要这个修复涂料，伤痕是男人的荣耀，这点小伤很快就会自己痊愈的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27509014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "格雷豪斯",
          "text": "听不懂吗小鬼，快我放下来！竟敢将我当作玩具对待！可恶，我要和你再战三百回合！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27509015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "格雷豪斯",
          "text": "别，不要，好了知道了！我涂就是了！让我自己来！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
